  "purpose": "Closed tag vocabulary for enterprise identity, campaign content, and agent cognitive states.",
  "principles": [
    "Tags describe content or agent state; they do not directly determine an action.",
    "LLM outputs must use only tag IDs from this file.",
    "Thought tags describe interpretation, appraisal, motivation, barriers, or timing.",
    "Emotion tags describe affective response after reading or viewing.",
    "Missing context does not imply a negative, neutral, or positive tag.",
    "Enterprise, article, and product tags are campaign metadata; thought and emotion tags are agent outputs."
